<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Captain Adel — AI flight instructor for Saudi civil aviation</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Captain Adel is an independent AI flight instructor for Saudi civil aviation. Ask about the GACAR regulations and get answers with the exact section cited. Educational — always verify against GACA.">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0A0E12">
  <link rel="icon" href="assets/img/captain/avatar.png" type="image/png">

  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="Captain Adel">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Captain Adel — AI flight instructor for Saudi civil aviation">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Ask the GACAR regulations and get answers with the exact section cited. Independent and educational.">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://captadel.com/">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://captadel.com/">

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/adel.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="disclaimer-strip">
    <div class="container">
      <span><strong>Independent educational reference.</strong> Not affiliated with GACA —
      always verify against the official source,
      <a href="https://gaca.gov.sa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gaca.gov.sa</a>.</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <header class="site-nav">
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <a class="lockup" href="/" aria-label="Captain Adel — home">
        <img src="assets/img/captain/avatar.png" alt="" width="40" height="40">
        <span>
          <span class="wordmark"><span class="wm-capt">Captain</span> <span class="wm-adel">Adel</span></span>
          <span class="lockup-sub">Saudi civil aviation</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="#what">What he does</a>
        <a href="#how">How it works</a>
        <a href="https://gaca.gov.sa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GACA ↗</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="chat.html">Ask Captain Adel</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <h1>The whole of Saudi aviation regulation, <span class="g">one captain on the answer.</span></h1>
          <p class="lede">Captain Adel is an independent AI flight instructor for Saudi civil
            aviation. Ask about the GACARs, airspace, licensing or operations — he answers
            with the exact section cited, and refuses rather than guess.</p>
          <div class="hero-cta">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="chat.html">Ask Captain Adel</a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#how">How it works</a>
          </div>
          <span class="cred"><span class="dot"></span> GACA ATPL · CFII · MEL · bilingual EN / العربية</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art">
          <img src="assets/img/captain/avatar.png" alt="Captain Adel">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="what" class="features">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>What he does</h2>
        <div class="cards">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Cited answers</h3>
            <p>Every regulatory claim carries a "GACAR Part X, §X.YYY" citation, with links to
            the source passage. No citation, no claim.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Refuses rather than guess</h3>
            <p>For minima, distances, weights and currency periods, a wrong number is worse than
            no number. If he can't ground it, he says so and points you to the Part.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Bilingual</h3>
            <p>Answers in the language you ask — English or العربية — keeping technical terms in
            the language of the regulation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="how" class="features" style="padding-top:0;">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>How it works</h2>
        <div class="cards">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Grounded in the GACARs</h3>
            <p>A lexical search over the GACA Aviation Regulations and topical books retrieves
            the relevant passages before Captain Adel answers — never from memory.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Saudi-first models</h3>
            <p>English runs on a fast frontier model; Arabic can run on ALLaM, the Saudi
            (HUMAIN) Arabic model, self-hosted in-Kingdom.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Educational, not operational</h3>
            <p>Captain Adel is a study and reference tool. GACA is always the authority; verify
            against the official publication before you rely on anything.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="footer-disclaimer">
        <strong>Unofficial &amp; educational.</strong> Captain Adel is an independent educational
        tool. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to the General Authority of
        Civil Aviation (GACA). The authoritative source for any regulation is always GACA.
        Always verify against the latest official GACA publication at gaca.gov.sa before relying
        on any information. Captain Adel is an educational AI and can be wrong — not for
        operational use in flight.
      </p>
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <span>&copy; <span id="year">2026</span> Captain Adel · Independent of GACA · Made in the Kingdom · صُنع في السعودية</span>
        <a href="mailto:hello@captadel.com">hello@captadel.com</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();</script>
</body>
</html>
